1
00:00:07,080 --> 00:00:08,920
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

2
00:01:35,200 --> 00:01:38,920
ADAPTED FROM <i>JIA JIN CHAI</i>, ORIGINAL NOVEL
BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

3
00:01:42,960 --> 00:01:43,840
Here.

4
00:01:45,280 --> 00:01:46,600
Have some more.

5
00:01:49,040 --> 00:01:50,440
- Mother.
- Have some more.

6
00:01:50,520 --> 00:01:52,240
Look how well-behaved this parrot is.

7
00:01:52,320 --> 00:01:54,280
His Majesty is still so devoted to you.

8
00:01:54,360 --> 00:01:55,640
Whenever he gets something fine,

9
00:01:55,720 --> 00:01:58,120
- he sends it to Changle Palace first.
- Look at you.

10
00:01:58,200 --> 00:01:59,240
Mother!

11
00:02:00,640 --> 00:02:03,120
Mother, my brother is going to kill
every member of the Han clan!

12
00:02:03,200 --> 00:02:05,640
Xiao, what are you talking about now?

13
00:02:05,720 --> 00:02:07,960
You already caused
enough trouble last time!

14
00:02:08,039 --> 00:02:09,600
Have you no manners at all?

15
00:02:11,120 --> 00:02:11,960
Mother,

16
00:02:12,480 --> 00:02:14,240
the Han clan is in grave danger.

17
00:02:14,320 --> 00:02:16,360
The Marquis of Xiting
and his son are in prison.

18
00:02:16,880 --> 00:02:17,960
The Empress is under house arrest too!

19
00:02:22,640 --> 00:02:24,960
I'm not dead yet,

20
00:02:25,040 --> 00:02:26,520
and he's already turned on the Han clan?

21
00:02:27,120 --> 00:02:28,920
Quick, summon him at once!

22
00:02:29,520 --> 00:02:30,600
Go!

23
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:35,360
Mother, don't worry.

24
00:02:36,240 --> 00:02:40,400
ABUNDANT GRACE, AUSPICIOUS TIMES

25
00:02:40,480 --> 00:02:42,680
You must get this letter
out of the palace.

26
00:02:45,560 --> 00:02:46,440
Keep it safe.

27
00:02:49,240 --> 00:02:51,240
- Rest assured, Your Majesty.
- Go.

28
00:02:56,080 --> 00:02:57,480
JIAOFANG PALACE

29
00:03:04,840 --> 00:03:06,240
Stop.

30
00:03:22,480 --> 00:03:24,280
Lady Li has arrived!

31
00:03:27,920 --> 00:03:28,960
Greetings, Your Ladyship.

32
00:03:34,520 --> 00:03:36,480
His Majesty is angry for the moment,

33
00:03:36,560 --> 00:03:38,000
but he'll show mercy
once his anger subsides.

34
00:03:38,960 --> 00:03:40,320
She is still the Empress.

35
00:03:41,240 --> 00:03:42,880
Show her some respect.

36
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:54,360
All provisions for Jiaofang Palace
must continue as before.

37
00:03:54,440 --> 00:03:57,160
Anyone who uses this to
deny her provisions or mistreat her

38
00:03:57,680 --> 00:04:00,400
will face severe punishment if I find out.

39
00:04:01,200 --> 00:04:02,320
Yes.

40
00:04:04,160 --> 00:04:05,560
JIAOFANG PALACE

41
00:04:05,640 --> 00:04:06,480
<i>Tell me,</i>

42
00:04:07,080 --> 00:04:09,160
what was the Empress trying to do?

43
00:04:09,240 --> 00:04:10,400
With her situation so desperate,

44
00:04:10,920 --> 00:04:12,800
she must have sent
a letter outside to seek help.

45
00:04:13,480 --> 00:04:15,080
Since you knew,

46
00:04:15,160 --> 00:04:17,160
why did you have me let her messenger go?

47
00:04:18,120 --> 00:04:20,959
Because Your Ladyship told me
His Majesty is deeply suspicious

48
00:04:23,160 --> 00:04:24,480
and thinks of everything.

49
00:04:25,240 --> 00:04:29,040
Once the eunuch leaves the palace,
whichever household's back door he enters,

50
00:04:29,120 --> 00:04:31,560
the Commandant's Office
will find out exactly where he went.

51
00:04:35,920 --> 00:04:38,600
My daughter is so clever.

52
00:04:38,680 --> 00:04:40,600
How could I have been so foolish,

53
00:04:41,760 --> 00:04:44,480
thinking that get you out of
these disputes would keep you safe?

54
00:04:49,080 --> 00:04:50,760
You had your own concerns, Your Ladyship.

55
00:04:52,400 --> 00:04:57,360
My daughter was always destined to
be drawn into palace politics.

56
00:05:03,160 --> 00:05:04,280
This time,

57
00:05:05,160 --> 00:05:06,760
I'm not after power.

58
00:05:09,040 --> 00:05:10,240
I'm after justice.

59
00:05:11,200 --> 00:05:13,200
XUANSHI PALACE

60
00:05:13,280 --> 00:05:15,080
His Majesty has only placed
the Empress under house arrest

61
00:05:15,160 --> 00:05:16,160
and has yet to make a decision.

62
00:05:16,880 --> 00:05:18,480
Could the Han clan still make a comeback?

63
00:05:19,480 --> 00:05:20,880
As long as the Empress Dowager is alive,

64
00:05:21,400 --> 00:05:23,080
His Majesty has to tread carefully.

65
00:05:23,160 --> 00:05:24,680
Then what do we do?

66
00:05:24,760 --> 00:05:26,040
Just let the Empress Dowager
meddle in state affairs?

67
00:05:26,720 --> 00:05:28,040
Han Liao got endless blood debts.

68
00:05:28,120 --> 00:05:29,960
Do we just watch him walk free again?

69
00:05:30,560 --> 00:05:32,040
Is there any justice left?

70
00:05:33,000 --> 00:05:34,480
I'll plead with His Majesty again.

71
00:05:37,160 --> 00:05:38,960
Justice isn't won by
begging on your knees.

72
00:05:39,960 --> 00:05:41,440
You have to risk lives and fight for it.

73
00:05:42,080 --> 00:05:43,120
You…

74
00:05:44,680 --> 00:05:45,760
Your Highness.

75
00:05:46,640 --> 00:05:47,760
Your Highness, wait.

76
00:05:50,400 --> 00:05:52,360
The Marquis of Xiting
and his son plotted treason.

77
00:05:52,440 --> 00:05:53,680
His Majesty is furious.

78
00:05:54,320 --> 00:05:55,920
Please leave it for your own sake.

79
00:05:56,600 --> 00:05:59,880
Don't provoke His Majesty now
and bring trouble on yourself.

80
00:06:03,040 --> 00:06:03,960
This is outrageous, Your Highness.

81
00:06:04,640 --> 00:06:05,880
Forgot where you are now?

82
00:06:06,520 --> 00:06:08,520
How dare you strike
someone outside Xuanshi Palace?

83
00:06:10,960 --> 00:06:13,000
Prince Jing is my brother's eldest son.

84
00:06:13,520 --> 00:06:16,200
The Han clan is
the Emperor's maternal family.

85
00:06:16,280 --> 00:06:17,680
Our family affairs

86
00:06:17,760 --> 00:06:20,800
are not for outsiders
like you to interfere with!

87
00:06:21,520 --> 00:06:24,200
If you dare slander us
before my brother again,

88
00:06:24,280 --> 00:06:27,120
I'll skin you alive!

89
00:06:28,160 --> 00:06:29,720
I wouldn't dare delay
your business, Your Highness.

90
00:06:31,360 --> 00:06:32,400
Please, go ahead.

91
00:06:37,240 --> 00:06:38,360
What a wretched place!

92
00:06:41,040 --> 00:06:41,960
Unbelievable.

93
00:06:42,040 --> 00:06:43,960
His Majesty had him
reflect on his conduct at home,

94
00:06:44,040 --> 00:06:45,320
yet he's grown more arrogant.

95
00:06:46,040 --> 00:06:47,600
That's exactly what we want.

96
00:06:49,680 --> 00:06:51,080
The more carried away he gets, the better.

97
00:06:55,360 --> 00:06:56,840
Your Majesty, take a good look.

98
00:06:56,920 --> 00:07:00,000
Every one of these memorials
pleads for mercy on the Han clan.

99
00:07:00,600 --> 00:07:02,120
The Empress is your first wife,

100
00:07:02,200 --> 00:07:03,480
and Prince Jing is your eldest son.

101
00:07:03,560 --> 00:07:05,600
What has made you so heartless?

102
00:07:05,680 --> 00:07:08,360
Do you care nothing
for the bonds of marriage

103
00:07:08,440 --> 00:07:09,440
or your own flesh and blood?

104
00:07:10,040 --> 00:07:12,440
Mother has a message for you.
If you want to wipe them out,

105
00:07:13,040 --> 00:07:14,560
she is one of the Hans.

106
00:07:15,080 --> 00:07:19,200
You might as well abandon your filial duty
and cut off your old mother's head too,

107
00:07:19,280 --> 00:07:21,440
so you can go down in history

108
00:07:21,520 --> 00:07:23,920
as a just ruler
who spared not even his own kin!

109
00:07:34,720 --> 00:07:37,640
The Empress
is consumed by jealousy and malice

110
00:07:38,520 --> 00:07:39,480
and is cruel at heart.

111
00:07:40,200 --> 00:07:42,800
She is unfit to honor the ancestors
or serve as a mother to the realm.

112
00:07:43,400 --> 00:07:45,640
I hereby strip her of her rank

113
00:07:46,400 --> 00:07:47,360
and condemn her to Yongxiang,
the palace prison.

114
00:07:48,400 --> 00:07:51,880
Prince Jing has failed to cultivate virtue
and engaged in treason.

115
00:07:52,520 --> 00:07:54,080
For the sake of
our bond as father and son,

116
00:07:54,720 --> 00:07:55,800
I spare his life,

117
00:07:56,720 --> 00:07:59,560
strip him of his rank,
and banish him to Hanzhong Commandery.

118
00:08:00,080 --> 00:08:02,640
The Han clan still refuses to confess?

119
00:08:03,840 --> 00:08:05,280
Tell Boyao to use severe torture.

120
00:08:06,200 --> 00:08:07,960
If he fails to get answers,

121
00:08:08,480 --> 00:08:11,480
- I will hold him accountable!
- Yes, Your Majesty.

122
00:08:11,560 --> 00:08:12,840
Your Majesty…

123
00:08:12,920 --> 00:08:14,120
Utter another word,

124
00:08:14,200 --> 00:08:16,600
and you'll be dragged
out and beaten to death!

125
00:08:24,920 --> 00:08:28,080
Mother, my brother also said…

126
00:08:28,600 --> 00:08:29,440
What did he say?

127
00:08:30,080 --> 00:08:32,880
The Emperor is a son to Heaven and Earth,

128
00:08:32,960 --> 00:08:34,120
and father to all the people.

129
00:08:34,720 --> 00:08:36,280
To be a good emperor to his people,

130
00:08:36,360 --> 00:08:39,280
he can no longer be a good son to you.

131
00:08:39,799 --> 00:08:40,679
Fine.

132
00:08:42,159 --> 00:08:44,800
What an impartial emperor he is!

133
00:08:45,520 --> 00:08:47,920
Doesn't he want to kill
every member of the Han clan?

134
00:08:48,880 --> 00:08:50,000
He needn't trouble himself.

135
00:08:50,680 --> 00:08:52,800
I will dash my brains out
outside Xuanshi Palace.

136
00:08:53,400 --> 00:08:55,200
Let the whole world see

137
00:08:55,280 --> 00:08:59,880
what a heartless, cold-blooded son I have!

138
00:09:00,480 --> 00:09:02,400
Yes! We can't let him do as he pleases!

139
00:09:02,480 --> 00:09:05,000
Shut your mouth, you fool!

140
00:09:06,960 --> 00:09:09,640
Mother, please don't act rashly.

141
00:09:10,160 --> 00:09:12,920
Remember when
you refused to eat in the past?

142
00:09:13,920 --> 00:09:16,120
His Majesty attended to you himself,

143
00:09:16,200 --> 00:09:17,480
showing the utmost devotion as your son.

144
00:09:18,160 --> 00:09:20,160
But now you've had neither food nor water.

145
00:09:20,240 --> 00:09:22,520
Has His Majesty come to see you even once?

146
00:09:23,280 --> 00:09:28,240
However deep your bond,
it can't withstand this constant strain.

147
00:09:28,320 --> 00:09:31,520
Mother, you mustn't go.

148
00:09:31,600 --> 00:09:34,840
If you do, your bond as mother and son

149
00:09:34,920 --> 00:09:36,320
will be severed for good.

150
00:09:37,320 --> 00:09:42,400
I can't stand by and watch
the entire Han clan be killed!

151
00:09:44,120 --> 00:09:49,920
As things stand, we can only
sacrifice one to save the rest.

152
00:09:56,880 --> 00:09:59,520
By His Majesty's decree,
Han is stripped of her rank.

153
00:10:00,120 --> 00:10:02,920
Her seal is to be reclaimed, and
she must leave the Empress's palace

154
00:10:03,000 --> 00:10:04,360
and move to Yongxiang.

155
00:10:04,880 --> 00:10:06,000
Commoner Han, come with us.

156
00:10:06,600 --> 00:10:07,840
Impossible.

157
00:10:09,040 --> 00:10:10,000
This is impossible.

158
00:10:11,960 --> 00:10:13,200
It can't be.

159
00:10:13,920 --> 00:10:15,480
- You can't take my seal!
- Quick!

160
00:10:15,560 --> 00:10:16,800
- Get it back!
- It's mine!

161
00:10:16,880 --> 00:10:18,720
You can't take my seal!

162
00:10:18,800 --> 00:10:20,960
- Get it back!
- You can't take my seal!

163
00:10:21,040 --> 00:10:22,160
If I'm unworthy of it,

164
00:10:22,240 --> 00:10:24,520
no one else shall have it!

165
00:10:24,600 --> 00:10:26,640
How dare you break the Empress's Seal!

166
00:10:26,720 --> 00:10:27,680
Do you have a death wish?

167
00:10:27,760 --> 00:10:31,520
I'm the Empress,
the Empress Dowager's niece!

168
00:10:32,200 --> 00:10:34,000
His Majesty can't treat me like this.

169
00:10:34,760 --> 00:10:37,400
I want to see the Empress Dowager!

170
00:10:37,480 --> 00:10:38,760
Quick, after her!

171
00:10:51,800 --> 00:10:52,800
Your Majesty.

172
00:10:54,040 --> 00:10:55,240
It's you.

173
00:10:56,240 --> 00:10:58,000
How dare you come to gloat over me?

174
00:11:01,760 --> 00:11:03,160
You believed

175
00:11:04,200 --> 00:11:06,440
wealth and noble birth made you superior.

176
00:11:06,520 --> 00:11:09,240
People's lives meant nothing to you.

177
00:11:09,320 --> 00:11:10,480
You couldn't have cared less.

178
00:11:11,920 --> 00:11:15,080
Now, you're covered in dirt yourself
and look utterly pitiful.

179
00:11:16,000 --> 00:11:17,480
When you killed Bitao,

180
00:11:19,040 --> 00:11:20,480
did you think you'd see this day?

181
00:11:22,960 --> 00:11:25,040
What Bitao? I know nothing about her.

182
00:11:26,560 --> 00:11:29,800
She was my maid, my friend,

183
00:11:30,720 --> 00:11:33,000
and the one who stood by me
through years of hardship.

184
00:11:36,240 --> 00:11:39,280
- For a mere servant, you dare…
- I dare!

185
00:11:41,360 --> 00:11:44,000
For Bitao, for myself,

186
00:11:44,640 --> 00:11:47,560
for all those whose lives and dignity
you people trampled on at will,

187
00:11:47,640 --> 00:11:48,880
there's nothing I wouldn't dare!

188
00:11:50,080 --> 00:11:51,440
Such insolence!

189
00:11:52,000 --> 00:11:53,600
My aunt will save me.

190
00:11:54,480 --> 00:11:56,480
- The Empress Dowager…
- Between you and the Han clan,

191
00:11:58,960 --> 00:12:00,440
the Empress Dowager can save only one.

192
00:12:05,560 --> 00:12:07,160
From this day on,

193
00:12:08,120 --> 00:12:11,920
your noble blood
and immense power mean nothing.

194
00:12:13,920 --> 00:12:16,480
Only hard labor awaits you
for the rest of your life.

195
00:12:17,600 --> 00:12:18,720
For the rest of your life,

196
00:12:19,920 --> 00:12:21,840
you'll live in Yongxiang,

197
00:12:21,920 --> 00:12:24,400
cowering like a homeless
dog with its tail between its legs.

198
00:12:30,760 --> 00:12:31,760
Do you understand,

199
00:12:33,000 --> 00:12:34,520
Commoner Han?

200
00:12:36,040 --> 00:12:38,120
I'll kill you, you vile woman!

201
00:12:38,200 --> 00:12:41,240
I'll kill you!

202
00:12:41,880 --> 00:12:44,240
Why are you letting a commoner
run wild in the palace?

203
00:12:44,920 --> 00:12:47,000
I'll kill you, you vile woman!

204
00:12:47,600 --> 00:12:49,680
I'll kill you!

205
00:13:00,280 --> 00:13:01,320
Lord Lu,

206
00:13:01,400 --> 00:13:03,600
Her Ladyship really isn't here.

207
00:13:03,680 --> 00:13:04,800
ZHUYU ESTATE

208
00:13:04,880 --> 00:13:07,920
Perhaps you could try looking up the hill.

209
00:13:11,080 --> 00:13:12,480
So she plans to go back on her word.

210
00:13:12,560 --> 00:13:14,240
Her word? What do you mean?

211
00:13:15,800 --> 00:13:18,840
Tell her she can't avoid me forever.

212
00:13:20,240 --> 00:13:23,960
However long she puts it off,
she'll have to give me what she owes me.

213
00:13:51,600 --> 00:13:53,560
- Your Ladyship.
- If Lord Lu comes,

214
00:13:53,640 --> 00:13:54,640
just say Her Ladyship isn't here.

215
00:13:55,240 --> 00:13:57,920
It's General Qi this time, not Lord Lu.

216
00:13:58,680 --> 00:14:01,080
He says he has good news for Her Ladyship.

217
00:14:01,160 --> 00:14:03,560
I didn't dare decide on my own.

218
00:14:04,600 --> 00:14:06,880
- Ask him to come over.
- Yes.

219
00:14:16,440 --> 00:14:17,480
Wei Rao!

220
00:14:18,160 --> 00:14:19,080
Wei Rao.

221
00:14:23,240 --> 00:14:25,120
You've refused to
see Lu Zhuo on three visits.

222
00:14:25,800 --> 00:14:26,680
Just hiding out doing farm work, huh?

223
00:14:28,080 --> 00:14:29,200
Something urgent?

224
00:14:29,880 --> 00:14:31,320
I came especially to tell you

225
00:14:32,000 --> 00:14:33,320
the Marquis of Xiting
has killed himself in prison.

226
00:14:36,120 --> 00:14:37,200
The Marquis of Xiting is dead?

227
00:14:37,960 --> 00:14:40,000
<i>Lu Zhuo kept up the pressure at every turn</i>

228
00:14:40,080 --> 00:14:41,720
<i>until the Han clan</i>
<i>had nowhere left to turn.</i>

229
00:14:42,640 --> 00:14:44,800
<i>The Marquis took poison and left a letter,</i>

230
00:14:45,320 --> 00:14:48,480
<i>claiming those 120 suits of armor</i>
<i>were meant to be buried with him.</i>

231
00:14:48,560 --> 00:14:49,400
MARQUIS OF XITING'S RESIDENCE

232
00:14:49,480 --> 00:14:50,920
<i>Since they were grave goods,</i>

233
00:14:51,000 --> 00:14:52,280
<i>and the Empress Dowager</i>
<i>tearfully pleaded for mercy,</i>

234
00:14:52,800 --> 00:14:54,000
<i>His Majesty showed leniency</i>

235
00:14:54,080 --> 00:14:55,720
<i>and didn't convict</i>
<i>the Han clan of treason,</i>

236
00:14:55,800 --> 00:14:57,840
<i>but of illegally hoarding weapons instead.</i>

237
00:14:58,360 --> 00:15:00,360
<i>Their title was revoked</i>
<i>and their property confiscated.</i>

238
00:15:00,440 --> 00:15:03,160
<i>Han Liao was also demoted three ranks</i>
<i>and left to serve in the army in disgrace.</i>

239
00:15:04,200 --> 00:15:07,240
<i>Too bad Han Liao escaped the worst.</i>

240
00:15:10,640 --> 00:15:12,320
<i>Of all the Han clan's members at court,</i>

241
00:15:12,920 --> 00:15:14,680
few dare fight on the battlefield.

242
00:15:15,400 --> 00:15:17,520
Most of them were pushed out
of the court's core.

243
00:15:18,160 --> 00:15:19,320
That's why the Empress Dowager
fought so hard to protect him.

244
00:15:19,920 --> 00:15:22,480
Is that all you came to tell me, General?

245
00:15:22,560 --> 00:15:24,080
There's something even more important.

246
00:15:24,160 --> 00:15:27,120
At court today, His Majesty named
Prince Duan as Crown Prince.

247
00:15:28,960 --> 00:15:29,880
I see.

248
00:15:38,680 --> 00:15:40,080
- Wei Rao…
- I only wanted

249
00:15:40,160 --> 00:15:41,560
the murderers to be punished.

250
00:15:42,400 --> 00:15:44,160
My wish came true. I have no regrets.

251
00:15:44,760 --> 00:15:48,560
Who becomes Empress or Crown Prince
has nothing to do with me.

252
00:15:49,160 --> 00:15:51,720
You don't care about state affairs,
or you are avoiding Lu Zhuo?

253
00:15:55,680 --> 00:15:58,560
What exactly did you promise him
that makes you so afraid of him?

254
00:16:05,680 --> 00:16:07,800
The chickens escaped! Catch them!

255
00:16:08,480 --> 00:16:09,680
Come and help!

256
00:16:10,760 --> 00:16:12,280
Aman, catch them!

257
00:16:23,920 --> 00:16:24,800
Don't run!

258
00:16:28,680 --> 00:16:31,040
- I'll block it here!
- Why is this so hard?

259
00:16:31,120 --> 00:16:33,360
Come here.

260
00:16:39,840 --> 00:16:40,840
Don't run!

261
00:16:42,320 --> 00:16:43,240
Got it!

262
00:16:43,320 --> 00:16:44,280
Catch it!

263
00:16:55,920 --> 00:16:59,000
She died in Shuzhou,
and both her children are missing.

264
00:17:00,240 --> 00:17:01,320
- You may go.
- Yes.

265
00:17:03,280 --> 00:17:06,319
- My Lady, word has come from Shuzhou.
- Over here!

266
00:17:06,400 --> 00:17:07,880
Madam Qiao fell ill and passed away.

267
00:17:08,440 --> 00:17:10,200
Her two children's
whereabouts are unknown.

268
00:17:10,880 --> 00:17:11,920
What did you say?

269
00:17:12,440 --> 00:17:13,520
- This one.
- Two wen.

270
00:17:13,599 --> 00:17:14,720
Fresh pastries!

271
00:17:14,800 --> 00:17:15,880
Here you are.

272
00:17:15,960 --> 00:17:16,960
Thank you.

273
00:17:17,040 --> 00:17:18,119
Let's go.

274
00:17:18,640 --> 00:17:20,760
Fresh pastries!

275
00:17:27,920 --> 00:17:28,760
Before Mother died,

276
00:17:29,440 --> 00:17:31,880
she kept telling us to
come back and find Rao.

277
00:17:31,960 --> 00:17:32,800
But look at you.

278
00:17:32,880 --> 00:17:34,480
You could be living in comfort,

279
00:17:34,560 --> 00:17:35,680
yet you're out here selling
flatbreads from dawn till dusk.

280
00:17:41,840 --> 00:17:45,280
Listen to me. We should
ask her for a few gold coins.

281
00:17:46,040 --> 00:17:48,120
Mother saved her life.
How could she refuse?

282
00:17:50,200 --> 00:17:51,400
Have you no shame?

283
00:17:51,920 --> 00:17:54,720
No girl has it worse
than one without a mother's love.

284
00:17:55,360 --> 00:17:57,040
Her birth mother didn't want her.

285
00:17:57,120 --> 00:17:59,040
The mother who raised her
fed her soup made from wild greens,

286
00:17:59,880 --> 00:18:01,520
and her whole family bled her dry.

287
00:18:02,440 --> 00:18:05,080
The money she gave us
was more than enough for the funeral.

288
00:18:05,600 --> 00:18:08,320
I can earn my own living. I'm not going.

289
00:18:13,640 --> 00:18:14,760
You…

290
00:18:14,840 --> 00:18:16,080
Skip today, you'll go tomorrow.

291
00:18:16,160 --> 00:18:17,120
If she refuses me,

292
00:18:17,200 --> 00:18:18,240
- Give that back!
- I'll shout it in the streets!

293
00:18:18,320 --> 00:18:20,840
Runsheng! Don't go gambling again!

294
00:18:21,560 --> 00:18:22,560
Excuse me.

295
00:18:22,640 --> 00:18:24,000
I'd like two sesame flatbreads.

296
00:18:26,400 --> 00:18:27,840
Two wen each.

297
00:18:27,920 --> 00:18:28,960
I'll take two.

298
00:18:40,080 --> 00:18:42,120
- You're back, Hongxian.
- Yes, Mr. Wang.

299
00:18:53,560 --> 00:18:54,880
Let go of me!

300
00:18:56,800 --> 00:18:58,680
Let go! Let go of me!

301
00:18:58,760 --> 00:19:00,560
Let go of me!

302
00:19:02,120 --> 00:19:03,520
Help!

303
00:19:03,600 --> 00:19:07,560
Help! Help! Let go!

304
00:19:07,640 --> 00:19:08,480
HOUSE OF FORTUNE

305
00:19:08,560 --> 00:19:11,480
All bets are final once placed!

306
00:19:11,560 --> 00:19:12,880
Place your bets!

307
00:19:13,600 --> 00:19:16,480
High!

308
00:19:16,560 --> 00:19:17,600
Low!

309
00:19:19,720 --> 00:19:21,840
- Again!
- Again!

310
00:19:21,920 --> 00:19:24,320
- High!
- Place your bets!

311
00:19:37,680 --> 00:19:40,560
What are you staring at? Behave!

312
00:20:06,120 --> 00:20:07,280
Did they abduct you too?

313
00:20:10,000 --> 00:20:12,720
My father's a constable.
He'll come and rescue me.

314
00:20:13,560 --> 00:20:14,640
Once I'm out,

315
00:20:14,720 --> 00:20:17,440
I'll have him arrest these traffickers
and have them beheaded.

316
00:20:29,440 --> 00:20:30,480
There's a banquet here tomorrow.

317
00:20:31,160 --> 00:20:32,560
Don't spend all your time
drinking and gambling.

318
00:20:33,200 --> 00:20:34,480
Keep a close watch on them.

319
00:20:35,160 --> 00:20:36,200
Understood.

320
00:20:41,800 --> 00:20:43,200
Food's ready. Gather around.

321
00:20:43,800 --> 00:20:45,120
Stop dawdling! Hurry!

322
00:20:45,800 --> 00:20:48,080
Hurry! What are you waiting for?
Stop dawdling!

323
00:20:48,840 --> 00:20:49,680
Hurry up!

324
00:20:49,760 --> 00:20:51,480
Do you two want to eat or not?

325
00:20:51,560 --> 00:20:52,440
Hurry.

326
00:20:52,520 --> 00:20:54,000
Move. You stink. Take it.

327
00:21:04,280 --> 00:21:05,320
Come on.

328
00:21:06,000 --> 00:21:07,120
What are you doing? Stop them!

329
00:21:07,200 --> 00:21:08,520
Stay inside!

330
00:21:08,600 --> 00:21:09,520
- Go after them!
- Get back!

331
00:21:12,920 --> 00:21:15,160
Stop! Stop them!

332
00:21:15,240 --> 00:21:17,560
- After them! Don't let them escape!
- Stop!

333
00:21:19,080 --> 00:21:20,520
- Stop!
- Stop!

334
00:21:22,240 --> 00:21:24,080
The potted plum trees
from the Empress Dowager

335
00:21:24,160 --> 00:21:25,600
will go here.

336
00:21:26,480 --> 00:21:27,720
Yes.

337
00:21:28,520 --> 00:21:29,640
Your Highness,

338
00:21:29,720 --> 00:21:32,120
this is a congratulatory
gift from the Censor-in-Chief.

339
00:21:32,200 --> 00:21:33,680
This natural black stone

340
00:21:33,760 --> 00:21:36,200
has white veins like
rolling, snow-white waves.

341
00:21:37,960 --> 00:21:39,320
It's a rare find indeed.

342
00:21:40,080 --> 00:21:41,560
The bamboo grove
outside His Highness's study

343
00:21:41,640 --> 00:21:43,120
could use an ornamental rock.

344
00:21:43,200 --> 00:21:44,520
Have it taken there.

345
00:21:44,600 --> 00:21:45,600
Yes.

346
00:21:46,760 --> 00:21:50,160
Shu, now that you're Crown Princess,

347
00:21:50,240 --> 00:21:51,600
you no longer have
to rely on anyone's favor.

348
00:21:51,680 --> 00:21:53,840
You can avenge Mother now, right?

349
00:21:55,200 --> 00:21:58,160
Chan, how many times have I told you?

350
00:21:58,240 --> 00:22:00,680
Sisters must support one another.

351
00:22:00,760 --> 00:22:03,120
We must never let infighting
give others an opening.

352
00:22:03,200 --> 00:22:06,760
Shu, have you forgotten
how much Mother loved you?

353
00:22:07,440 --> 00:22:08,840
You've forgotten all she did for you.

354
00:22:09,440 --> 00:22:10,920
I'm not speaking to you anymore.

355
00:22:11,840 --> 00:22:12,960
The greater good comes first.

356
00:22:13,040 --> 00:22:15,960
Help! Bandits!

357
00:22:16,040 --> 00:22:16,920
- Hold her down!
- Don't move!

358
00:22:17,000 --> 00:22:18,040
- What's going on?
- Help!

359
00:22:18,120 --> 00:22:19,000
Behave!

360
00:22:21,320 --> 00:22:22,120
Enough, Chan.

361
00:22:22,880 --> 00:22:25,560
You should go home.
Don't make Grandmother worry.

362
00:22:26,400 --> 00:22:28,240
- Escort Lady Chan home.
- Yes.

363
00:22:29,680 --> 00:22:30,960
This way, Lady Chan.

364
00:22:40,440 --> 00:22:42,440
BEHOLD THE WAVES

365
00:22:42,520 --> 00:22:45,200
We have a guest here. Why all this noise?

366
00:22:47,240 --> 00:22:49,000
- Behave!
- Let go!

367
00:22:52,160 --> 00:22:53,360
Your Highness,

368
00:22:53,440 --> 00:22:56,200
we've been very busy these past two days.

369
00:22:56,280 --> 00:22:58,560
Some maids got into
trouble and are being punished.

370
00:22:58,640 --> 00:22:59,640
We wouldn't want to trouble you with this.

371
00:23:00,400 --> 00:23:01,400
Take them away.

372
00:23:02,320 --> 00:23:03,640
Your Ladyship! Your Ladyship!

373
00:23:04,240 --> 00:23:05,240
Please save us!

374
00:23:05,320 --> 00:23:08,240
- They abducted me!
- Take her away! Quickly!

375
00:23:09,200 --> 00:23:10,920
- Your Ladyship! Your Ladyship!
- My sister is Noble Lady Wu'an!

376
00:23:12,040 --> 00:23:13,840
Abducting a noble lady's
sister is punishable by death!

377
00:23:13,920 --> 00:23:14,760
Let me go at once,

378
00:23:14,840 --> 00:23:16,360
or neither Heaven
nor the law will spare you!

379
00:23:17,040 --> 00:23:18,360
Stop! Let go of her.

380
00:23:23,200 --> 00:23:24,160
Your Ladyship,

381
00:23:24,680 --> 00:23:26,320
I really am Noble Lady Wu'an's sister.

382
00:23:26,920 --> 00:23:28,680
Send someone to Zhuyu Estate.

383
00:23:28,760 --> 00:23:30,000
If my sister knows you've freed me,

384
00:23:30,080 --> 00:23:34,120
she'll reward you handsomely
and repay your kindness.

385
00:23:41,040 --> 00:23:42,640
What exactly is going on?

386
00:23:42,720 --> 00:23:45,280
There are many
more girls locked back there.

387
00:23:45,360 --> 00:23:47,440
They were all abducted and brought here.

388
00:23:47,520 --> 00:23:50,000
If you don't believe me,
Your Ladyship, go and see for yourself.

389
00:23:54,600 --> 00:23:55,680
Lead the way.

390
00:24:07,720 --> 00:24:09,720
Come on. We're saved.

391
00:24:26,520 --> 00:24:28,520
They're all so young.

392
00:24:28,600 --> 00:24:29,880
These poor girls.

393
00:24:31,840 --> 00:24:34,000
Your Ladyship, we were all abducted!

394
00:24:34,080 --> 00:24:36,880
Your Ladyship!
Let us go home, Your Ladyship!

395
00:24:36,960 --> 00:24:37,840
Your Ladyship, let us go home!

396
00:24:37,920 --> 00:24:39,640
You're kind and merciful.

397
00:24:39,720 --> 00:24:41,160
Please save us!

398
00:24:41,240 --> 00:24:42,760
Save us!

399
00:24:42,840 --> 00:24:45,440
Please let us go home, Your Ladyship!

400
00:24:45,520 --> 00:24:46,520
Your Ladyship!

401
00:24:54,600 --> 00:24:56,400
You can't even
handle something this simple.

402
00:24:57,320 --> 00:24:58,720
What use are you?

403
00:25:13,440 --> 00:25:17,040
Deal with those who tried to escape
in the usual way.

404
00:25:17,120 --> 00:25:18,160
Yes.

405
00:25:43,800 --> 00:25:46,760
I'll haunt you even after I die!

406
00:25:48,680 --> 00:25:50,600
No!

407
00:25:52,760 --> 00:25:56,120
Even with her dying breath,
she had to curse me.

408
00:25:57,680 --> 00:25:59,480
Drive a peachwood sword through her heart,

409
00:26:00,280 --> 00:26:01,920
cut out the tongue
she planned to use against us,

410
00:26:02,520 --> 00:26:05,800
burn her to ashes, and bury
them beneath the garden paving.

411
00:26:05,880 --> 00:26:07,280
Let countless feet trample her.

412
00:26:08,240 --> 00:26:10,280
Let's see how her spirit haunts me then.

413
00:26:17,200 --> 00:26:21,720
You claim to be Noble Lady Wu'an's sister.

414
00:26:22,800 --> 00:26:24,880
When did the Wei family
gain a girl like you?

415
00:26:25,640 --> 00:26:26,760
How did I not know?

416
00:26:26,840 --> 00:26:30,520
Lying is a bad habit, but don't worry.

417
00:26:31,080 --> 00:26:32,360
I can rid you of it.

418
00:26:33,360 --> 00:26:34,200
Is everything ready?

419
00:26:35,440 --> 00:26:36,680
She's different from the others.

420
00:26:36,760 --> 00:26:38,520
His Highness had her brought here.

421
00:26:43,520 --> 00:26:44,520
Bring it in.

422
00:26:49,920 --> 00:26:51,320
No!

423
00:26:51,920 --> 00:26:53,520
Wei Rao really is my sister!

424
00:26:54,520 --> 00:26:55,680
I'm not lying!

425
00:26:55,760 --> 00:26:58,280
Please let me go! I'm not lying!

426
00:26:58,360 --> 00:27:00,040
If you're lying, I won't let you go.

427
00:27:00,640 --> 00:27:02,080
If it's true, all the more reason
to keep you here.

428
00:27:03,280 --> 00:27:05,200
The moment you set foot in this residence,

429
00:27:05,760 --> 00:27:07,880
you lost any chance of ever leaving.

430
00:27:09,040 --> 00:27:11,440
Lowly girl, how dare
you claim kinship with a noble lady?

431
00:27:15,840 --> 00:27:17,680
Use molten lead as the key ingredient

432
00:27:20,480 --> 00:27:22,760
to cure her of these outrageous lies.

433
00:27:23,880 --> 00:27:27,160
Please spare me!

434
00:27:27,840 --> 00:27:29,200
- Give her the medicine.
- Please!

435
00:27:30,000 --> 00:27:32,480
No!

436
00:27:34,280 --> 00:27:37,640
No!

437
00:27:51,400 --> 00:27:53,520
Many honored guests will be here tomorrow.

438
00:27:54,440 --> 00:27:58,400
Make sure
the little birds out back keep quiet.

439
00:27:59,280 --> 00:28:00,240
Yes.

440
00:28:03,960 --> 00:28:05,040
<i>Rao!</i>

441
00:28:05,560 --> 00:28:07,040
<i>Rao!</i>

442
00:28:07,120 --> 00:28:11,320
<i>Rao, save me! Save me!</i>

443
00:28:11,400 --> 00:28:12,680
<i>Rao!</i>

444
00:28:17,920 --> 00:28:18,880
What's wrong, My Lady?

445
00:28:19,480 --> 00:28:22,400
I heard Hongxian's voice.
She was calling for me.

446
00:28:23,360 --> 00:28:26,760
All the estate's guards are out searching.
If she really has returned to the capital,

447
00:28:27,480 --> 00:28:28,680
they'll find her.

448
00:28:29,440 --> 00:28:30,800
Please don't worry, My Lady.

449
00:28:32,720 --> 00:28:36,880
You're attending a banquet
at the Crown Prince's residence today.

450
00:28:37,560 --> 00:28:39,520
Let me help you wash and dress.

451
00:28:39,600 --> 00:28:41,560
No need. I'll do it myself.

452
00:28:42,600 --> 00:28:45,720
I've already told them
to report to you immediately

453
00:28:45,800 --> 00:28:47,200
as soon as they have any leads.

454
00:28:51,720 --> 00:28:54,240
Have them check
every gambling house in the capital too.

455
00:28:56,440 --> 00:28:57,560
Yes.

456
00:29:07,200 --> 00:29:10,000
- Come next time.
- Take care.

457
00:29:10,080 --> 00:29:11,800
- It's fresh.
- Sir, come and have a look!

458
00:29:11,880 --> 00:29:13,320
Come and see!

459
00:29:13,400 --> 00:29:15,240
SILKS AND FINE FABRICS

460
00:29:20,680 --> 00:29:21,600
Lord Lu.

461
00:29:22,200 --> 00:29:24,400
My Lady, it's Lord Lu.

462
00:29:30,680 --> 00:29:32,680
I'm in a hurry to attend
the Crown Prince's banquet.

463
00:29:33,200 --> 00:29:34,120
Please let us pass, Lord Lu.

464
00:29:35,080 --> 00:29:36,880
Lord Lu has a few words for Your Ladyship.

465
00:29:36,960 --> 00:29:38,800
He'll leave once heard.
Please step out of the carriage.

466
00:29:44,120 --> 00:29:45,760
What's so urgent, Lord Lu,

467
00:29:47,000 --> 00:29:48,000
that you had to stop me here?

468
00:29:53,240 --> 00:29:54,440
What are you doing?

469
00:29:55,880 --> 00:29:56,920
I have guards with me.

470
00:29:57,640 --> 00:29:58,920
Your Ladyship promised

471
00:29:59,640 --> 00:30:00,680
that once we brought down our enemies,

472
00:30:01,280 --> 00:30:02,600
you'd take me back.

473
00:30:03,440 --> 00:30:05,680
Were you only stringing me along?

474
00:30:07,720 --> 00:30:09,880
You barged into my room
in the middle of the night,

475
00:30:10,400 --> 00:30:13,160
threatened me, tempted me,
and did all the talking.

476
00:30:13,240 --> 00:30:14,480
I never agreed to anything.

477
00:30:18,280 --> 00:30:21,600
Your Ladyship really is two-faced
and never keeps a promise.

478
00:30:21,680 --> 00:30:23,320
You haven't even crossed the river,

479
00:30:23,400 --> 00:30:25,080
yet you're rushing to
tear the bridge down.

480
00:30:28,600 --> 00:30:29,880
But I have my pride too.

481
00:30:30,680 --> 00:30:32,120
I won't keep pestering you.

482
00:30:42,040 --> 00:30:43,240
Rest assured.

483
00:30:44,120 --> 00:30:45,600
I won't mention this again,

484
00:30:47,600 --> 00:30:49,320
and you needn't avoid me like the plague.

485
00:30:50,600 --> 00:30:51,440
Really?

486
00:30:55,200 --> 00:30:56,200
Unless you beg me yourself,

487
00:30:57,320 --> 00:30:58,720
I won't bring it up again.

488
00:30:58,800 --> 00:31:00,720
<i>Beg you? Dream on.</i>

489
00:31:01,800 --> 00:31:04,000
How generous of you,
Lord Lu. I'll be on my way.

490
00:31:05,520 --> 00:31:06,640
Wait.

491
00:31:10,840 --> 00:31:11,880
Zhao Bai.

492
00:31:19,200 --> 00:31:21,960
He's strong and skilled
at riding and archery.

493
00:31:22,040 --> 00:31:24,480
He's also well-versed in music
and knows how to be good company.

494
00:31:25,040 --> 00:31:26,880
He can cheer you up when you're troubled.

495
00:31:27,640 --> 00:31:30,240
Are you offering me
Deputy General Zhao, Lord Lu?

496
00:31:30,840 --> 00:31:34,200
At today's banquet,
you'll have no shortage of such offers.

497
00:31:35,000 --> 00:31:36,080
Not that I'd be invited.

498
00:31:36,760 --> 00:31:37,880
Do try to keep your composure

499
00:31:37,960 --> 00:31:41,040
and avoid being
taken advantage by the schemers.

500
00:31:53,400 --> 00:31:56,200
Your Ladyship,
what did Lord Lu say to you?

501
00:31:57,320 --> 00:32:00,120
Odd remarks.
I couldn't make sense of them.

502
00:32:00,200 --> 00:32:01,160
Pay him no mind.

503
00:32:03,120 --> 00:32:06,320
‪-Sure.
‪-Good.

504
00:32:06,880 --> 00:32:08,480
You can certainly hold your liquor!

505
00:32:30,000 --> 00:32:31,440
Congratulations, Your Highness.

506
00:32:39,160 --> 00:32:40,360
All right.

507
00:32:41,280 --> 00:32:42,560
Have a drink too.

508
00:32:47,920 --> 00:32:50,000
Your Ladyship, please.

509
00:32:54,120 --> 00:32:55,080
Keep your distance.

510
00:32:55,800 --> 00:32:58,000
<i>He's strong and skilled</i>
<i>at riding and archery.</i>

511
00:32:58,080 --> 00:32:59,800
<i>He's also well-versed in music</i>
<i>and knows how to be good company.</i>

512
00:33:00,840 --> 00:33:03,720
<i>At today's banquet,</i>
<i>you'll have no shortage of such offers.</i>

513
00:33:03,800 --> 00:33:05,200
So that's what he meant.

514
00:33:20,080 --> 00:33:21,440
The one in there is lucky.

515
00:33:21,520 --> 00:33:22,960
His Highness has his eye on her.

516
00:33:23,040 --> 00:33:25,760
Otherwise, she'd be buried tonight too.

517
00:33:25,840 --> 00:33:27,120
He'll lose interest in a couple of days.

518
00:33:28,600 --> 00:33:30,200
The Crown Princess is quite something.

519
00:33:30,280 --> 00:33:32,400
She likes letting them escape,
then catching them again.

520
00:33:32,480 --> 00:33:33,920
We should learn a few new tricks.

521
00:33:34,000 --> 00:33:36,120
Make His Highness laugh,
and he'll reward us handsomely.

522
00:33:36,200 --> 00:33:37,360
All right, enough.

523
00:33:45,800 --> 00:33:47,840
You little charmer.

524
00:33:49,760 --> 00:33:52,000
This is your first banquet
of this kind, Your Ladyship.

525
00:33:52,080 --> 00:33:52,920
You'll get used to it.

526
00:33:53,520 --> 00:33:54,640
I'm not like them.

527
00:33:56,080 --> 00:33:57,280
Have a drink!

528
00:33:59,000 --> 00:34:01,080
Cheng was meant for
the Eldest Princess's Residence.

529
00:34:01,160 --> 00:34:03,520
But the Crown Princess said,
His Highness owes his success

530
00:34:03,600 --> 00:34:04,560
to Your Ladyship.

531
00:34:04,640 --> 00:34:06,840
So His Highness sent
Cheng to attend to you.

532
00:34:08,760 --> 00:34:10,040
Fill it up!

533
00:34:21,159 --> 00:34:22,320
Take it away.

534
00:34:34,320 --> 00:34:36,239
How fortunate I am to
meet an old friend tonight.

535
00:34:37,560 --> 00:34:39,320
Yet Your Ladyship
doesn't seem to recognize me.

536
00:34:40,239 --> 00:34:43,440
Now that you've risen in the world,
have you forgotten your old friends?

537
00:34:44,080 --> 00:34:45,440
Do you remember the Liu family's mill?

538
00:34:54,600 --> 00:34:55,760
A-Chou.

539
00:35:11,480 --> 00:35:14,400
There are many things about this world
that Your Ladyship finds distasteful.

540
00:35:15,000 --> 00:35:17,120
But nobles have
their eggs painted before eating them

541
00:35:17,200 --> 00:35:19,400
and patterns carved into their firewood.

542
00:35:20,440 --> 00:35:23,040
As the saying goes,
"the Emperor treasures pearls and jade,

543
00:35:23,120 --> 00:35:24,640
and feudal lords, gold and stone.

544
00:35:25,240 --> 00:35:28,680
Ministers keep dogs and horses,
and commoners store cloth and silk."

545
00:35:29,440 --> 00:35:31,080
Know one's station,

546
00:35:31,160 --> 00:35:32,760
do one's part.

547
00:35:33,560 --> 00:35:36,600
Wealth and power are now
within Your Ladyship's reach.

548
00:35:36,680 --> 00:35:38,480
Others like you indulge in pleasure.

549
00:35:38,560 --> 00:35:40,520
You should feel free to enjoy it too.

550
00:35:42,800 --> 00:35:45,600
The Eldest Princess
has countless favorites.

551
00:35:45,680 --> 00:35:47,080
I won't trade on my looks.

552
00:35:47,600 --> 00:35:48,640
I willingly serve Your Ladyship.

553
00:35:49,280 --> 00:35:51,960
I may not be skilled in performances,
but I'm quick with numbers.

554
00:35:52,480 --> 00:35:54,520
I can stay by your side as a trusted aide.

555
00:35:55,880 --> 00:35:58,600
Will you take me with you, Your Ladyship?

556
00:36:12,440 --> 00:36:14,320
I knew you still remembered me.

557
00:36:19,200 --> 00:36:21,120
Who said Wu'an couldn't be won over?

558
00:36:22,560 --> 00:36:24,440
You really are a thoughtful cousin.

559
00:36:25,480 --> 00:36:27,240
Your gift was just what she wanted.

560
00:36:39,560 --> 00:36:40,480
<i>See?</i>

561
00:36:41,000 --> 00:36:43,360
<i>Everyone's the same, after all.</i>

562
00:36:43,880 --> 00:36:49,160
CROWN PRINCE'S RESIDENCE

563
00:36:51,280 --> 00:36:53,520
My Lord, you already warned Her Ladyship.

564
00:36:53,600 --> 00:36:55,000
She'll surely be on her guard.

565
00:36:56,000 --> 00:36:56,960
Not necessarily.

566
00:36:58,440 --> 00:36:59,880
Real mind games, after all,

567
00:37:00,840 --> 00:37:01,920
few can stand against it.

568
00:37:02,920 --> 00:37:05,560
Then, My Lord,
why don't you attend the banquet yourself?

569
00:37:07,160 --> 00:37:09,800
She doesn't want to see me.
Why should I go?

570
00:37:15,000 --> 00:37:16,240
Let's go home.

571
00:37:17,480 --> 00:37:18,600
Let's go.

572
00:37:25,080 --> 00:37:27,360
She won't let those
handsome men fool her, will she?

573
00:37:39,040 --> 00:37:40,160
After her!

574
00:37:46,840 --> 00:37:49,080
<i>Rao!</i>

575
00:37:51,840 --> 00:37:52,960
Quick, after her!

576
00:38:03,800 --> 00:38:04,960
Split up!

577
00:38:06,600 --> 00:38:09,120
I'm done. No more for me.

578
00:38:11,360 --> 00:38:12,680
Dance with me.

579
00:38:25,920 --> 00:38:27,880
For that dish of phoenix tongues just now,

580
00:38:28,600 --> 00:38:30,720
it took the finest tongues from
over a thousand buntings

581
00:38:30,800 --> 00:38:32,400
just to fill one small plate.

582
00:38:33,760 --> 00:38:35,360
As for this meat stew,

583
00:38:35,440 --> 00:38:38,280
the steamed deer tails may smell strong,

584
00:38:39,200 --> 00:38:41,440
but that's what makes them so nourishing.

585
00:38:42,520 --> 00:38:44,040
Try some, everyone.

586
00:38:44,120 --> 00:38:46,960
Thank you, Your Highness!

587
00:38:56,640 --> 00:38:58,560
That's delicious.

588
00:39:06,600 --> 00:39:08,600
If you leave, His Highness will punish me.

589
00:39:09,760 --> 00:39:12,560
- Let go.
- Despite my warm hospitality,

590
00:39:13,680 --> 00:39:15,480
your cousin doesn't
seem to be enjoying herself.

591
00:39:24,000 --> 00:39:25,200
Your Ladyship, please take me with you.

592
00:39:32,920 --> 00:39:33,800
Let go.

593
00:39:35,720 --> 00:39:36,760
Your Ladyship…

594
00:39:37,720 --> 00:39:38,720
Rao.

595
00:39:42,520 --> 00:39:45,160
His Highness' appointment as Crown Prince,
you are chiefly to thank.

596
00:39:45,240 --> 00:39:48,600
Let me offer you a toast on his behalf.
Please drink the whole cup.

597
00:39:49,360 --> 00:39:50,240
You give me too much credit.

598
00:40:00,600 --> 00:40:02,080
Your Ladyship, we've found someone.

599
00:40:03,240 --> 00:40:05,200
There's urgent business at the estate.
I must return at once.

600
00:40:05,800 --> 00:40:07,760
Your hospitality has been most generous.
I'll thank you properly another day.

601
00:40:08,800 --> 00:40:10,040
Leaving so soon?

602
00:40:12,640 --> 00:40:16,200
Very well. I know what you're like.
I won't keep you.

603
00:40:17,240 --> 00:40:19,720
Cheng, go home with Her Ladyship.

604
00:40:20,320 --> 00:40:22,480
Be sure to serve her well.

605
00:40:25,360 --> 00:40:26,680
Did you fail to attend to her properly?

606
00:40:27,560 --> 00:40:30,440
Her Ladyship
seems reluctant to take you with her.

607
00:40:31,440 --> 00:40:33,600
Please take me in.
I'll work myself to the bone

608
00:40:33,680 --> 00:40:35,680
to repay your kindness.

609
00:40:35,760 --> 00:40:36,840
I have other urgent business.

610
00:40:36,920 --> 00:40:38,600
Aman, take him back to the estate.

611
00:40:55,720 --> 00:40:58,960
- Sure.
- Fill my cup again!

612
00:41:02,160 --> 00:41:03,880
What are you doing?
I was about to win my money back!

613
00:41:03,960 --> 00:41:06,320
Let go of me! Who are you?

614
00:41:08,160 --> 00:41:09,360
Who on earth are you?

615
00:41:10,000 --> 00:41:12,440
My sister is Noble Lady Wu'an!

616
00:41:13,040 --> 00:41:14,520
I'll have her deal with you!

617
00:41:20,480 --> 00:41:22,800
- Rao. What are you doing here?
- Where's Hongxian?

618
00:41:23,480 --> 00:41:25,280
I told her to come find you,
but she refused.

619
00:41:25,880 --> 00:41:28,280
- We rented an old house nearby.
- Take me there.

620
00:41:30,080 --> 00:41:32,840
Rao, do you have any gold coins?

621
00:41:33,680 --> 00:41:35,440
Lend… lend me some
so I can win my money back.

622
00:41:38,680 --> 00:41:39,880
Lead the way!

623
00:41:45,960 --> 00:41:47,080
Give it to me!

624
00:41:47,160 --> 00:41:48,680
- Hand it over!
- I saw it first!

625
00:41:48,760 --> 00:41:50,000
- Let go!
- I saw it first!

626
00:41:50,080 --> 00:41:51,560
- I took it, so it's mine!
- Give it to me!

627
00:41:51,640 --> 00:41:53,080
- Let go!
- You let go!

628
00:41:53,160 --> 00:41:54,000
Hand it over!

629
00:41:54,080 --> 00:41:55,520
- You've already taken so much!
- Give it to me!

630
00:41:56,560 --> 00:41:57,400
It's mine!

631
00:41:57,480 --> 00:41:59,000
- These belong to my family!
- You've already taken so much!

632
00:42:00,200 --> 00:42:01,520
You're stealing from us!

633
00:42:02,120 --> 00:42:03,080
She's never coming back.

634
00:42:03,680 --> 00:42:05,640
A hopeless gambler
like you can't run a business.

635
00:42:05,720 --> 00:42:07,160
All these would go to waste.

636
00:42:07,240 --> 00:42:08,440
- What's wrong with us taking a few?
- Exactly!

637
00:42:08,520 --> 00:42:09,360
You…!

638
00:42:10,480 --> 00:42:11,720
Oh, heavens!

639
00:42:11,800 --> 00:42:12,920
What do you mean, she's never coming back?

640
00:42:13,000 --> 00:42:14,320
Where did Hongxian go?

641
00:42:14,400 --> 00:42:17,840
She said it.
She said Miss Hongxian had been abducted,

642
00:42:17,920 --> 00:42:19,160
and there would be no one
to claim her belongings.

643
00:42:19,240 --> 00:42:20,400
That's why I came to take them.

644
00:42:20,480 --> 00:42:22,680
Spare me, Your Ladyship! Spare me!

645
00:42:22,760 --> 00:42:24,440
- What nonsense are you spouting?
- Spare me, Your Ladyship!

646
00:42:24,520 --> 00:42:26,160
You had to be so greedy!

647
00:42:26,240 --> 00:42:28,080
You already took so much,
yet you still fought me for a sieve!

648
00:42:28,160 --> 00:42:29,000
Who abducted Hongxian?

649
00:42:29,760 --> 00:42:31,960
As soon as Miss Hongxian left the alley,

650
00:42:32,040 --> 00:42:33,920
several burly men rushed at her.

651
00:42:34,000 --> 00:42:35,600
They gagged her, covered
her head, and took her away.

652
00:42:36,280 --> 00:42:38,800
- I don't know who they were.
- Which way did they go?

653
00:42:38,880 --> 00:42:40,000
Which way…

654
00:42:40,080 --> 00:42:41,400
Tell her!

655
00:42:41,480 --> 00:42:43,560
East! They went east!

656
00:42:43,640 --> 00:42:44,720
They went east.

657
00:42:50,280 --> 00:42:52,080
Easy!

658
00:42:53,120 --> 00:42:55,240
AS THE SUN RISES

659
00:42:56,440 --> 00:42:57,960
He's the biggest broker in this area.

660
00:42:58,040 --> 00:43:00,560
Every sale of a slave goes through him.

661
00:43:02,840 --> 00:43:03,840
Have you seen her?

662
00:43:05,040 --> 00:43:07,440
No. Never.

663
00:43:09,640 --> 00:43:10,480
Look carefully!

664
00:43:10,560 --> 00:43:12,320
I'm innocent!

665
00:43:12,400 --> 00:43:15,600
Spare me, Your Ladyship!
I really haven't seen her.

666
00:43:15,680 --> 00:43:17,640
- But…
- But what?

667
00:43:17,720 --> 00:43:18,920
To tell you both the truth,

668
00:43:19,520 --> 00:43:23,280
over the past two years,
many girls have gone missing in the city.

669
00:43:23,360 --> 00:43:25,840
The youngest are barely 13,
the oldest only 15 or 16.

670
00:43:25,920 --> 00:43:28,360
You turn your back for a moment,
and someone just vanishes.

671
00:43:29,320 --> 00:43:30,840
Haven't the authorities investigated?

672
00:43:30,920 --> 00:43:32,560
They're just girls from poor families.

673
00:43:32,640 --> 00:43:35,680
Who knows whether
they starved to death, died from hardship,

674
00:43:35,760 --> 00:43:38,720
were taken by traffickers,
or abducted by bandits?

675
00:43:38,800 --> 00:43:40,800
There's no way to trace what happened.

676
00:43:42,000 --> 00:43:46,920
Some refused to give up
and even petitioned the Court of Justice.

677
00:43:47,000 --> 00:43:49,360
But nothing ever came of it.

678
00:43:50,640 --> 00:43:52,320
Those powerful officials
only concern themselves

679
00:43:52,400 --> 00:43:54,400
with state affairs.

680
00:43:54,480 --> 00:43:56,800
Who would care about
what happens to poor families?

681
00:43:58,400 --> 00:44:00,600
Listen. Alive or dead, I want her found!

682
00:44:01,200 --> 00:44:02,880
Don't think you can
talk your way out of this!

683
00:44:02,960 --> 00:44:04,720
If I've told you a single lie,

684
00:44:04,800 --> 00:44:07,040
may a bolt of lightning
strike me dead on the spot!

685
00:44:07,880 --> 00:44:10,200
- Qi Zhongkai.
- Please don't hit me!

686
00:44:14,840 --> 00:44:17,240
Your Ladyship,
Lord Lu insisted on barging in.

687
00:44:17,320 --> 00:44:18,840
You couldn't have stopped him. It's fine.

688
00:44:19,760 --> 00:44:21,320
Even if you kill him tonight,

689
00:44:21,840 --> 00:44:23,280
there are things
he won't dare to tell you.

690
00:44:25,360 --> 00:44:26,240
Do you know who's behind this?

691
00:44:28,760 --> 00:44:30,080
I don't.

692
00:44:30,920 --> 00:44:33,080
But I know someone dares to abduct girls

693
00:44:33,160 --> 00:44:34,800
right in the capital,
acting without a care,

694
00:44:35,320 --> 00:44:36,760
committing crimes over the years,

695
00:44:38,240 --> 00:44:41,240
while the people dare not ask questions,
and the authorities dare not investigate.

696
00:44:42,920 --> 00:44:45,800
What kind of person has that much power?

697
00:44:47,280 --> 00:44:48,720
Someone of royal or noble blood.

698
00:44:50,000 --> 00:44:50,840
Could it be Prince Rong?

699
00:44:51,520 --> 00:44:53,680
It can't be. Prince Rong is lustful,

700
00:44:54,400 --> 00:44:56,760
but the women he favors
are beautiful, voluptuous widows.

701
00:44:57,800 --> 00:44:59,040
Everyone in the capital knows it.

702
00:44:59,960 --> 00:45:02,960
He just told us
the missing girls were all very young.

703
00:45:03,560 --> 00:45:07,040
Anyone who abducts girls
must have bought and sold them too.

704
00:45:07,920 --> 00:45:10,040
You run the city's largest brokerage.

705
00:45:10,120 --> 00:45:13,040
You know all the secret tastes
of the capital's rich and powerful.

706
00:45:13,640 --> 00:45:16,320
Tell us the truth,
and I'll let you live.

707
00:45:17,000 --> 00:45:19,840
I swear to Heaven,
I know nothing about it!

708
00:45:22,080 --> 00:45:23,960
My estate has taken
in many displaced people.

709
00:45:24,040 --> 00:45:26,640
Many brokers like you have tried to abduct

710
00:45:27,240 --> 00:45:29,400
and sell children and
young girls amid the chaos.

711
00:45:30,240 --> 00:45:32,560
Do you know what I do to them
once I find them?

712
00:45:34,200 --> 00:45:39,040
Her Ladyship's estate is orderly
because she has one ironclad rule.

713
00:45:39,120 --> 00:45:41,520
Anyone found abducting
and selling women or children

714
00:45:43,520 --> 00:45:44,920
is paraded through
the streets for three days,

715
00:45:46,480 --> 00:45:47,440
then executed by slow slicing.

716
00:45:48,720 --> 00:45:50,080
Do you know what slow slicing means?

717
00:45:50,800 --> 00:45:52,440
Three thousand cuts,

718
00:45:52,960 --> 00:45:54,040
carving you up while you're alive.

719
00:45:55,480 --> 00:45:57,000
No, please don't!

720
00:45:57,080 --> 00:46:00,480
I'll talk! I've only heard a few rumors.

721
00:46:00,560 --> 00:46:03,400
If word gets out,
my entire family will be killed!

722
00:46:05,240 --> 00:46:06,760
I'll talk!

723
00:46:06,840 --> 00:46:10,000
There are quite a few
powerful men in the capital

724
00:46:10,080 --> 00:46:12,120
with this taste,

725
00:46:12,200 --> 00:46:13,960
but the only one even the Commandant
of Justice won't dare investigate

726
00:46:14,760 --> 00:46:16,840
- is…
- Who?

727
00:46:16,920 --> 00:46:20,200
The Crown Prince.

728
00:48:41,440 --> 00:48:44,480
‪NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED
‪IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
